---
import Service from '../layouts/Service.astro';
import { SRC, NAP } from '../data/site';
const faqs = [
  { q: 'Where is the chartered accountant office in Adyar?', a: 'The office of CA S. A. Abdul Rahim is at 14/2, 15th Cross Street, Shastri Nagar, Adyar, Chennai 600020, between Adyar signal, Indira Nagar and Besant Nagar. It is open Monday to Saturday from 8:00 am to 8:00 pm. Please call or send a WhatsApp message before visiting.' },
  { q: 'Is CA S. A. Abdul Rahim a member of ICAI?', a: 'Yes. S. A. Abdul Rahim is a Chartered Accountant and a member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI), in practice since 12 April 1985. Membership can be checked on the ICAI website. The office follows the ICAI Code of Ethics in all its work.' },
  { q: 'Can I get my ITR filed at the Adyar office without visiting?', a: 'Yes. Many clients from Adyar, Besant Nagar and Thiruvanmiyur share Form 16, bank statements and the AIS by WhatsApp or email. The office prepares the return, explains the working by phone, and files it after you confirm. A visit is useful for first-time clients or for property and capital gains matters.' },
  { q: 'What does CA mean in Chennai, and is it the same as auditor?', a: 'CA stands for Chartered Accountant. In Chennai, people often call a Chartered Accountant an auditor, because only a CA can sign a statutory audit or tax audit report. So a search for an auditor office, a CA office or a chartered accountant in Adyar usually means the same kind of office.' },
  { q: 'Which languages are spoken at the Adyar CA office?', a: 'Tamil, English and Hindi are spoken at the office. You can discuss your income tax return, GST registration, TDS on property purchase or a notice in the language you are comfortable with, and the office will explain each step and document in plain words before anything is filed.' },
];
---
<Service
  title="Chartered Accountant in Adyar, Chennai: CA Office"
  description="CA office in Shastri Nagar, Adyar, Chennai, since 1985: ITR filing, GST registration and filing, TDS on property purchase, tax audit and registrations."
  path="/chartered-accountant-in-adyar/"
  h1="Chartered Accountant (CA) in Adyar, Chennai"
  name="Chartered Accountant in Adyar"
  topic="your tax and accounts work in Adyar"
  lead="The office of CA S. A. Abdul Rahim, Chartered Accountant, is in Shastri Nagar, Adyar, Chennai, and has been in practice since 1985. It handles income tax return (ITR) filing, GST registration and GST filing, TDS on property purchase (Form 141, earlier 26QB), tax audit, notices, and company, LLP, trust and Udyam registrations for people and businesses in Adyar and nearby areas."
  faqs={faqs}
  related={['/income-tax-return-filing-chennai/', '/gst-registration-chennai/', '/tds-on-property-purchase-26qb/', '/tax-audit/', '/auditor-in-adyar/']}
  sources={[SRC.icai, SRC.itPortal, SRC.gst]}
>
  <h2>What the CA office in Adyar does</h2>
  <p>Most of the work at the office falls into five groups. Each links to a page with the documents and steps.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">If you need</th><th scope="col">What is usually involved</th><th scope="col">Page</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Income tax filing (ITR filing)</td><td>Choosing the right ITR form, matching Form 16, AIS and Form 26AS, claiming deductions and refunds</td><td><a href="/income-tax-return-filing-chennai/">ITR filing</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>GST number (GST registration) and GST filing</td><td>Checking whether registration is needed, the application on gst.gov.in, monthly or quarterly GSTR-1 and GSTR-3B</td><td><a href="/gst-registration-chennai/">GST registration</a>, <a href="/gst-return-filing/">GST filing</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>TDS on property purchase</td><td>TDS of 1 percent when you buy a property of Rs 50 lakh or more, Form 141 (earlier 26QB), the challan and Form 16B or its new equivalent for the seller</td><td><a href="/tds-on-property-purchase-26qb/">TDS on property</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Audit</td><td>Tax audit for businesses and professionals above the limits, statutory audit of companies, audit of trusts</td><td><a href="/tax-audit/">Tax audit</a>, <a href="/statutory-audit/">Statutory audit</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Notices and registrations</td><td>Income tax and GST notices, company, LLP, partnership, trust, 12A and 80G, and Udyam registration</td><td><a href="/income-tax-notice-reply-chennai/">Notice reply</a>, <a href="/company-llp-registration-chennai/">Company registration</a></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>

  <h2>Who comes to the office</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Salaried people and pensioners</strong> in Adyar, Indira Nagar, Gandhi Nagar and Kasturba Nagar filing their yearly ITR, often with interest, capital gains or rent.</li>
    <li><strong>Property buyers and sellers</strong> in South Chennai, where many flats and plots cross Rs 50 lakh and TDS on property purchase applies.</li>
    <li><strong>NRIs</strong> who own a house in Adyar or Besant Nagar and sell or let it out, and need lower TDS certificates or returns in India.</li>
    <li><strong>Shops, traders, doctors and consultants</strong> who need a GST number, GST filing, accounts and, above the limits, a tax audit.</li>
    <li><strong>Trusts, schools and associations</strong> that need 12A and 80G registration, audit and ITR-7.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How a matter is handled</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>First call or WhatsApp.</strong> You tell the office what you need; the office tells you which documents to share.</li>
    <li><strong>Documents.</strong> You share them by WhatsApp, email or in person at Shastri Nagar.</li>
    <li><strong>Working and check.</strong> The office prepares the return, form or reply and explains it to you before filing.</li>
    <li><strong>Filing and records.</strong> After your confirmation, it is filed on the official portal and you receive the acknowledgement.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>{NAP.addressLine}. The office is about 1 km from Adyar signal and Indira Nagar MRTS station, and about 2 km from Besant Nagar and Thiruvanmiyur. Routes from other parts of South Chennai are on the <a href="/areas/">areas and directions</a> page. For audit work, see <a href="/auditor-in-adyar/">auditor in Adyar</a>. {NAP.hoursText}</p>
  <p>Membership of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India can be checked on <a href="https://www.icai.org/" rel="noopener">icai.org</a>. Returns and forms are filed only on the official portals, such as <a href="https://www.incometax.gov.in/" rel="noopener">incometax.gov.in</a> and <a href="https://www.gst.gov.in/" rel="noopener">gst.gov.in</a>.</p>
</Service>
